# Next.js / React Guidelines (override)

## Rendering strategy
- Prefer **Server Components**; minimise `use client`.
- Wrap client components in `<Suspense>`; lazy-load with `next/dynamic`.

## Styling & UX
- TailwindCSS (mobile-first). No inline styles except quick prototyping.
- Optimise images with `next/image`, preload critical LCP assets.

## Security
- Perform `<SECURITY_REVIEW>` for any input/HTML rendering: note XSS/CSRF mitigation.

## Code conventions
- Functional components only (override global “classes allowed” rule).
- Descriptive const arrow functions (`const submitForm = async () => { ... }`).
- Event handlers prefixed with `handle`.
